  "abercarn": "Abercarn sits within the Ebbw Fach valley, historically shaped by coal mining and metalworks, with modern light industrial units now occupying former colliery sites. The town serves businesses across the Caerphilly County Borough, including engineering workshops and steel fabrication firms operating from nearby Cwmcarn and Crosskeys industrial areas. Commercial Shot Blasting's mobile surface preparation service is ideally positioned to support these valley-based manufacturers, eliminating the need for lengthy transport of heavy components to distant facilities and minimising operational downtime for local contractors.",
